WEBVTT

00:10:58.935 --> 00:11:03.063
But the only problem is we had
no money to start the program.

00:11:03.087 --> 00:11:04.362
(Laughter)

00:11:04.386 --> 00:11:06.032
Absolutely nothing.

00:11:07.853 --> 00:11:12.406
Development partners wanted to see data
before associating with my vision.

00:11:13.057 --> 00:11:16.511
Of course, political opponents
laughed at me.

00:11:17.304 --> 00:11:19.311
But I campaigned that a nation

00:11:19.335 --> 00:11:22.220
that invests in human capital development

00:11:22.244 --> 00:11:24.598
through free, quality education,

00:11:24.622 --> 00:11:27.876
affordable and high-quality
health care services

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:29.343
and food security

00:11:29.367 --> 00:11:33.412
will accelerate its national
development program.